<sect1 id="chapter12_1autotoc_md61_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter12_1autotoc_md61">
<title>sattyre-registry examples</title><para>Serve packages locally. Publish archives to the registry. Fetch packages by name. List available packages.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">sattyre-registry<sp/>serve<sp/>--host<sp/>127.0.0.1<sp/>--port<sp/>8080<sp/>--root<sp/>./registry-root</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">sattyre-registry<sp/>publish<sp/>./pkg.satpkg<sp/>--url<sp/>http://127.0.0.1:8080</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">sattyre-registry<sp/>fetch<sp/>demo-solver<sp/>--url<sp/>http://127.0.0.1:8080</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">sattyre-registry<sp/>list<sp/>--url<sp/>http://127.0.0.1:8080</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
