<sect1 id="chapter12_1autotoc_md63_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter12_1autotoc_md63">
<title>Testing matrix</title><para>Parser tests: DIMACS and manifest parsing behavior. ABI tests: solver/plugin/library compatibility and metadata. Package flow tests: bundle, install, remove. Registry smoke tests: local and optional HTTP checks. CLI smoke tests for each tool.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">ctest<sp/>--test-dir<sp/>build/release<sp/>--output-on-failure</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ctest<sp/>--test-dir<sp/>build/release<sp/>-R<sp/>sattyre-packman-cli-test<sp/>--output-on-failure</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
