<sect1 id="chapter12_1autotoc_md65_1s1"><sect2 id="chapter12_1autotoc_md65">
<title>Release checklist</title><para>Public headers install cleanly under <computeroutput>include/sattyre</computeroutput>. <computeroutput>sattyre.pc</computeroutput> is generated and installable. Docs build produces HTML, LaTeX, DocBook, and XML outputs. Version and compatibility policy are documented.</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".text"><codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>-S<sp/>.<sp/>-B<sp/>build/release<sp/>-DSATTYRE_ENABLE_TESTS=ON<sp/>-DSATTYRE_ENABLE_DOCS=ON</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>--build<sp/>build/release<sp/>-j</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>--build<sp/>build/release<sp/>--target<sp/>sattyre-docs</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
